sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User (PM)
    participant T as RA Bills tab
    participant L as approvalChains.js
    participant PG as Postgres
    participant RPC as record_audit_v2()
    participant A2 as audit_log_v2

    U->>T: click "Approve RA bill #7"
    T->>L: resolveApprover(org, 'ra_bill', amount, now)
    L-->>T: {approver: pm, rung: 1, requireSig: true}
    T-->>U: signature pad
    U->>T: signs

    T->>T: optimistic UI: status='approved'
    T->>PG: UPDATE ra_bills SET status='approved', approved_by=user.id

    par Audit + State (single txn)
        PG-->>T: 1 row updated
        T->>RPC: record_audit_v2('APPROVE','ra_bill', $id, before, after, msg)
        RPC->>RPC: lookup actor profile (SECURITY DEFINER)
        RPC->>RPC: derive org_id from org_members
        RPC->>A2: INSERT audit_log_v2 (no UPDATE/DELETE policy exists)
        Note over A2: row sealed — cannot be edited
    end

    A2-->>T: realtime (org_id channel)
    T-->>U: green check + activity feed row

    Note over A2: next morning at 00:30 IST
    A2-->>A2: anchor-digest cron picks up yesterday's rows<br/>and pins their merkle root to Polygon
